    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. how would you actually structure the classroom activities? like, if we're looking at the 'regressive' side, what kind of arguments should i present to the kids so they understand the logic they were using, even if it was ultimately wrong?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
